Package: phewasFlow
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Bidirectional Phenome-Wide Association Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Lars",
    family = "Fritsche",
    email = "larsf@umich.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Author: Lars Fritsche [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Lars Fritsche <larsf@umich.edu>
URL: https://github.com/FritscheLab/phewasFlow,
    https://fritschelab.github.io
BugReports: https://github.com/FritscheLab/phewasFlow/issues
Description: Defines explicit, validated specifications for bidirectional
    phenome-wide association studies. It fits Firth logistic, linear,
    negative-binomial, and cumulative-link models; preserves skipped and
    failed associations; applies family-wide multiple-testing correction;
    supports deterministic local and sharded execution; and provides matched
    model contrasts, concordance summaries, and publication-ready graphics.
